  "description": "UQAWAO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H49 Br4 N8 Nd4 O29 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,2(C1 H4 O1),C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.658-5.070 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.97-161.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H75Br4N10Nd4O31.",
